  aciklama:
  - "Hi\xE7 denizde kollar\u0131n\u0131 yanlara a\xE7\u0131p s\u0131rt \xFCst\xFC
    \xF6ylece uzand\u0131n m\u0131 {{isim}}? Kulaklar\u0131n\u0131 t\u0131kayan sular,
    \xE7evre seslerini bo\u011Fuk ve uzaklardan gelen, ruhu dinlendiren bir \"u\u011Fultu\"
    haline getirir. Kapatt\u0131\u011F\u0131n g\xF6z kapaklar\u0131n, g\xFCne\u015F
    \u0131\u015F\u0131nlar\u0131n\u0131n rahats\u0131z etmeyecek bir miktar\u0131n\u0131
    s\u0131zd\u0131r\u0131p, \xF6n\xFCnde duran k\u0131z\u0131l bir \"perde\" halini
    al\u0131r. \u0130\u015Fte seni fal\u0131nda tam da bu halde g\xF6r\xFCyorum.
    E\u015Finle ayr\u0131 oldu\u011Fun bu s\xFCre\xE7te pek \xE7ok \u015Feye \xFCz\xFClm\xFC\u015F,
    nihayet kendini kader denizinin merhametli kollar\u0131na b\u0131rakm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Dalgalar ise seni nereye ta\u015F\u0131yor, biliyor musunuz? Daha g\xFCzel g\xFCnlere!..."
